# Normalise to LF in the repo. The packager runs on Linux; CRLF in .toc files
# has bitten WoW addon builds before.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.zip binary
# Shipped texture. Normalised as text it would be CRLF-mangled into a corrupt
# file inside the packaged zip while still working from a local checkout.
*.tga binary
